To install the venv with its dependencies run setup.ps1

If you modify the requirements.in, run
    pip-compile requirements.in
to update requirements.txt, and then
    pip install -r requirements.txt

To compile the Slides to videos and then slides use
    manim-slides render app/main.py Main
or, if you have many sub-mobjects,
    manim-slides render app/main.py Main --disable_caching


To run the Slides in a slideshow use
    manim-slides Main

To convert the slides and videos into an .html, you want to use
    manim-slides convert SCENE scene.html -ccontrols=true
unless you don't want the controls at the bottom